#AI:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="src/test/**"

TEST_COMMAND:
- mvn test (Maven) or ./gradlew test (Gradle)
- mvn verify for integration tests (Failsafe)

TEST_CONVENTIONS:
- JUnit 5 (@Test, @BeforeEach, etc.)
- Unit tests: FooTest.java in src/test/ mirroring src/main/
- Integration tests: FooIT.java (Maven Failsafe) or @SpringBootTest
- Mockito for mocking dependencies
- AssertJ for fluent assertions

COVERAGE_REQUIREMENTS:
- (fill in — e.g., "JaCoCo minimum 80% line coverage enforced in CI")

FORBIDDEN_IN_TESTS:
- No real database in unit tests — use @DataJpaTest with H2 or Testcontainers
- No real external HTTP calls — use MockMvc or WireMock
- No Thread.sleep() for async testing — use Awaitility
